quran[22]{c,v,t}:
  85,1,"By the sky full of constellations,"
  85,2,"by the Promised Day,"
  85,3,and by the witness and the witnessed:
  85,4,Perished are the people of the trenches!
  85,5,"The fire (pit), full of fuel,"
  85,6,"when they sat around it,"
  85,7,as they were witnessing what they were doing to the believers.
  85,8,"They were vindictive towards them only because they had believed in Allah, the All-Mighty, the All-Praised,"
  85,9,"to Whom belongs the kingdom of the heavens and the earth, and Allah is Witness over everything."
  85,10,"Indeed, those who persecute the believing men and the believing women and then do not repent will have the punishment of Hell, and for them, there is a (severe) torment of burning."
  85,11,"Indeed, those who believe and perform righteous deeds—for them will be Gardens with rivers flowing beneath them. That is the supreme success."
  85,12,"Indeed, your Lord’s striking is very severe."
  85,13,"It is He Who originates and brings back again,"
  85,14,"and He is the Most-Forgiving, the All-Affectionate,"
  85,15,"the Lord of the Throne, the All-Glorious,"
  85,16,Doer of whatever He intends.
  85,17,"Has the story of the (destroyed) forces reached you,"
  85,18,(the troops) of Pharaoh and Thamud?
  85,19,Yet the disbelievers are (persistently) in denial.
  85,20,But Allah besieges (them) from all sides.
  85,21,"Rather, it is a Glorious Qur’an,"
  85,22,in a Guarded Tablet.
